window.products.push({"id":963013,"name":"Digital Kitchen Timer, 100H Count UP/Down Cooking Timer, Large Display, Vibration/Flashlight/Loud Alarm, 24-Hour Clock & Alarm Clock, Magnetic Backing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xTJQWSctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Timloon Digital Kitchen Timers Large Display Count UP/down Timer   Slow cooking, slow roasting or barbequing can even be timed with this handy device. The timer can be set for up to 99hours 99 minutes 99 second.  Product Features ★Easy to read clear digits digital display shows hours minutes and seconds by LCD display sreen. ★It's not necessary to keep your eye on the clock when you have the Timloon Direct Entry Kitchen Cooking Timer Alarm, cooking timer with alarm can be heard in another part of the house. ★With 24-hour clock and alarm clock, The unique alarm clock feature offers more options. ★Three alarm modes, vibration, flash, and sound. Bring better reminder so you can notice it in time. ★The timer keeps track of how long your dish has been cooking or how long it still needs to cook with its count up or down features. Set the timer for your roast and go about the rest of your chores, the long and loud alarm will alert you when the meal is real to be served. ★The timer comes with a magnet, sturdy little plastic fold-out stand and the hook on the back. ★You can open to stand it on a shelf.Plus the magnet on the back is strong enough to hold it up on a fridge/oven.  Package Includes: 1x Digital Timer 1x Product Manual 2x AAA batteries","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xTJQWSctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Timloon","source_asin":"B07MKTH667","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MKTH667","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MKTH667","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
