window.products.push({"id":963134,"name":"Qoosea Fireplace Heater Electric Fireplace 1500W 750W 3D LED Flame Log Electric Heater with Adjustable Thermostat with Realistic Flame Optics Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xoOVBHxxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥 2 in 1 Electric Fireplace: Qoosea Electric Fireplace is heating and fireplace in one, it provides you with heat and creates with LED flame effect a pleasant and cozy ambience. It has two adjustable heating levels 750 Watt and 1500 Watt. This heater can be used after switching on, and a beautiful flame illusion comes to life and immerses the room in muffled light, just like a real fireplace. 🔥 Four modes to choose from: The heater offers four modes, flame and warm mode 750 W, flame and warm mode 1500 W, flame mode without heater, warm mode without flame. With the adjustable heating level, you can set the electric heater to 750 W or 1500 W. Since the heating function can be regulated separately, you can enjoy the fireplace look even without heating. Fireplace atmosphere: Our heaters run electrically and therefore do not generate real flames, 🔥 LED creates a pleasant flicker effect that simulates a cozy open fire. With 4.5 kg weight and handle design, you can place the fireplace anywhere without risk of fire. In addition, there is the advantage that there is no ash or dirt. 🔥 Overheat protection: For safety, the fireplace is equipped with an overheating protection. It will stop heating while the temperature reaches the set value, so you can fall asleep without hesitation while enjoying the warmth of the fireplace. NOTE: BUT please place it in a stable place to prevent it from being accidentally knocked over. 🔥 Nostalgic design: The classic design of this electric fireplace impresses with its simplicity and elegance. Whether rustic or modern, the electric heater conjures realistic flame illusions in every room. With the carrying handle, the heater can be quickly and easily placed anywhere. It is the best gift for your family, friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xoOVBHxxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qoosea","source_asin":"B0BG5R8D7R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG5R8D7R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG5R8D7R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
