window.products.push({"id":963236,"name":"Goplus 2ft Pre-lit Tabletop Christmas Tree, Battery Operated Artificial Xmas Tree w/ 40 LED Lights, Ornaments and Timer, for Indoor Festival Holiday D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uVL6N7+4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄 Perfect Size for Christmas Table Decorations: This 2 feet desktop Christmas tree consists of a tree trunk and a base. With a compact size, the tree is perfect for decorating your desk or dining table during Christmas holiday. Besides, it’s also suitable to decorate shopping mall, school, office, and so on to increase festival atmosphere. 🎄 LED Lights with 6-hour Timer:The Christmas tree comes with 40 pre-strung LED lights. And built-in timing device(3 AA batteries are not included) can automatically turn off after turning on the light for 6 hours, which can save energy for you. Put it in your home or workplace to create a festive atmosphere. 🎄 Realistic & Lush Appearance: This Christmas tree is very eye-catching with its realistic and lush appearance. The 80 branch tips endow the tree with dense and full appearance. At the same time, the tree is connected with a retro cement base, which not only adds the stability to the tree, but also makes the tree looks more gorgeous. 🎄 Durable Faux Leaves: The branch tips are made of 100% new PVC material, which is uneasy to fading or deforming to last for years. Coupled with exquisite craftsmanship, the leaves of the Christmas tree are thick and uneasy to fall off, thus ensure its durability and aesthetics. 🎄 Plenty of Ornaments: The Christmas tree is pre-assembled with all classic Christmas elements, including balls, snowflakes, bows, berries and so on. So, there is no need to buy extra decorations, and you don't need to spend time thinking about how to decorate the tree. Get this tree and you can solve the Christmas decoration problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uVL6N7+4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goplus","source_asin":"B09BJ57R1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BJ57R1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BJ57R1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":963237,"name":"ZooeyRoose Green Hydrangea Artificial Flower 3pcs 21in Large Real Touch Latex Royal Faux Flower Head with Long Stem for Home Outdoor Garden Wedding Br","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LhHwpq0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📐Size and Package📏: Total length: 21 \" (53CM), the diameter of flower head: 8.6 \" (22 CM), the length of flower head: 4.7 \" (12CM), Diameter of the stem: 0.5\" (1.2CM); Bigger, softer, fuller and more real touch than other cheap artificial hydrangeas. Each flower head consists of 196 small petals by hand, when the petals fall off you can easily put back; In the packing box: there are 3 hydrangea flower heads, 3 thick stems, 9 leaves (not includ vase). 🌼Lifelike Material🌺: Artificial hydrangea made of high quality 3D printed latex + rubber tube plastic + wire, The petal part is made of latex, softer and more real touch than other plastic and silk flowers, after spraying water can be cohesive water droplets. Leaves and thick stems have real patterns and colors. So it can be comparable to real flowers. The flower stems are wire wrapped in rubber tubing plastic and can be bent or cut to suit your needs. 💗Warm Tips❕❗: We'll Separate packaging of flower head and flower stem for transport. When you first receive the package, the flower head looks small, which is a normal situation because the flower head is fluffy and put in the box, they will be squeezed and deformed during the transportation process. You can use hands or hot hair dryer to adjust the flowers to a full bloom. If there is a smell, you can put it outside for ventilation, but do not expose it to the sun for too long. 🧊Flexible Decor🍶: Hydrangea artificial flower head and stem can be separated. Flower heads can be made into wreath, garland, decorative cake, decorative wedding. Long stems can be bent or cut, put into tall vases and short vases for decorating home. Suitable for DIY flower arrangements, can be mixed and matched with any flower, making your DIY creations flexible and diverse. 👰‍♀️Occasions💍: Hydrangea artificial flower are suitable for decorating wedding, holiday, party, home, hotel, restaurant, table center, baby shower, and other decorations. Ideal as a gift for your lover, friends and family who are allergic to flowers. They are a perfect decoration choice when you don't have time to water and fertilize flowers, gardening activities, taking care of garden decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LhHwpq0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZooeyRoose","source_asin":"B09LH6P2C1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LH6P2C1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LH6P2C1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
