window.products.push({"id":963261,"name":"Miniature Easel Print with Magnet: You Are One Amazing Lady, 3.6\" x 4.9\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BZXDgBP7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether it takes center stage on a desk or is casually displayed on the fridge, a Blue Mountain Arts Miniature Magnetic Easel-Back Print is the perfect way to let the special people in your life know just how much they are loved and appreciated. Each beautifully crafted mini print is fashioned from thick, rigid paperboard and features a variety of embellishments, 3-dimensional accents or cut-outs that make each one truly unique. The back of the mini print has both a sturdy easel stand with space to write a quick \"to and from\" as well as an oversized magnet that will securely adhere to any metal surface. And, with themes that include family, friendship, relationships, encouragement, love and more, they're the perfect addition to any card or gift or just as a spur-of-the-moment purchase to brighten someone's day! Since 1971, Blue Mountain Arts has been helping people communicate their deepest, most sincere thoughts and feelings about love, friendship, family, ideals and dreams. The Colorado-based company founded by poet Susan Polis Schutz and physicist/illustrator Stephen Schutz is known world-wide for its innovative art styles, quality paper and ever-increasing selection of authors, artists, and product lines. The same quality and high standards established with the very first Blue Mountain Arts products continue today to make them standouts in the marketplace, filling a very unique and necessary need ... that of helping people communicate their feelings and connect with the special people in their lives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BZXDgBP7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Mountain Arts","source_asin":"B00G6S33Z4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G6S33Z4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G6S33Z4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
