window.products.push({"id":963657,"name":"Rock Your Chakra Pure Copper Nugget 2 1/2\" 4-6 Oz Native Copper Rocks and Minerals Root Chakra Healing Crystals and Stones Specimen Reiki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SAFJVUNjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Rock Your Chakra sources these pure copper nuggets from a supplier that mines them from the Keweenaw Peninsula of Michigan. Our supplier custom makes these for us without the clear spray paint coating. Virtually all other copper nuggets sold are coated with a clear coating to prevent them from tarnishing green over time as natural copper does. Who wants clear plastic spray paint on their prized mineral specimens? Not me! Only the best products for our customers!A few times a year just use a little copper cleaner to remove the green oxidation or apply your own clear spray coating if desired.You will receive one Copper Nugget from the lot shown in the photos that is 2 1/2 inch to 3 inch and weighs between 4 and 6 ounces. Healing Properties It is believed that copper has the power to amplify thoughts when sending and receiving psychic communications. New Age followers carry copper with their stones and crystals to 'straighten' the properties of them, as well they are used when crating crystal wands to be certain of their clear and straight powers. Copper is also quite instrumental in the physical and mental healing rites of many peoples of this world. Medicinally copper has been used for thousands of years. Mineral Description Native copper is a form of copper that occurs as a natural mineral. Copper is one of the few metallic elements to occur in native form. Copper is a chemical element with symbol Cu (from Latin: cuprum). It is a soft, malleable, and ductile metal with very high thermal and electrical conductivity. A freshly exposed surface of pure copper has a reddish-orange color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SAFJVUNjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rock Your Chakra","source_asin":"B07XQJW4DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XQJW4DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XQJW4DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
