window.products.push({"id":963705,"name":"HOMEVER 12-15 Cup Touch Screen Programmable Automatic Timing Coffee Maker, 1050W Warm Keep & Fast Brewer, Self Cleaning with Permanent Filter, 60 oz C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aqC2N+taL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"24-hour timer and LCD touch screen : HOMEVER filter coffee machine can be programmed up to 24 hours in advance. You can leave it ready at night and program it to make your coffee when your alarm goes off. This way you will wake up by smelling the coffee in the morning. The LCD touchscreen is very easy to use and more elegant than mechanical buttons. Satisfactory extraction & 4H keeping warm : Thanks to the constant temperature extraction technology, HOMEVER filter coffee machine can balance the acidity of the coffee and release its aroma. The water touches the coffee powder evenly and creates a wonderful taste. The keep warm function can keep the coffee fresh for up to 4 hours. You can even set the temperature between Low, Medium and High to your liking. 1.8 L coffee pot and drip protection system : This drip pot has a larger water sink capacity 1.8L (60oz), for 12 cups or 15 cups when use 120-150ml size cup. It's perfect for a big party with family or friends. The drip stop prevents coffee from dripping onto the heating plate when the jug is removed. Filtration function & self-cleaning : The nylon filter is permeable, reusable and can easily be removed for cleaning. So you can save the cost of disposable paper filters. Cleaning the filter coffee machine is also so easy. You don't have to worry about boring wait staff. At the push of a button, the machine thoroughly cleans the interior itself. Our Responsibilty : Our products have undergone strict quality inspections. If you find any dissatisfaction during receipt and use of the product, please feel free to contact our customer service, we will be serious and patient to provide you with help and solutions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aqC2N+taL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEVER","source_asin":"B085ZZVL1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085ZZVL1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085ZZVL1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":963706,"name":"RUGTUDER White Soft Area Rug for Bedroom,8x10,Fluffy Rugs,Big Rug,Shag Carpet Living Room,Furry Rugs Girls Boys Room,Shaggy Kids Baby Room,Fuzzy Dorm ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814GwDsdPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUGTUDER Rug RUGTUDER is your secret to help make a house into your home, If you are looking to boost the look of your home without spending on new furniture, our rug is the best option to go.It’s surprising how much a soft rug can do for your home. Enhance your decor and express your sense of style with a simple rug that feels attractive,comfortable,and inviting. Shaggy floor rugs details: Our rug is consists of 3 parts:Super soft velvet surface,Sponge interlayer,and Non-slip plastic spots bottom. Color options:Black,Grey,Light Grey,Navy blue,White,Pink,Beige,Creamy,Ivory,Purple,Red,Baby Blue. Size options:2 Feet x 4 Feet,3 Feet x 5 Feet,4 Feet x 6 Feet,5 Feet x 8 Feet,6 Feet x 9 Feet,8 Feet x 10 Feet. 2 Feet x 4 Feet and 3 Feet x 5 Feet suitable for bedside,under the chair, and nursery room. 4 Feet x 6 Feet and 5 Feet x 8 Feet,suitable for kid room,Adult room,and playroom. 6 Feet x 9 Feet and 8 Feet x 10 Feet,suitable for living room and bedroom. Shaggy rugs cleaning： 1, Shaking it off, to get extra debris out. 2, Use a low-power vacuum cleaner. 3, Add some mild detergent and gently wash the carpet by hand, then put the rug in the ventilation to dry. Packaging： In order to prevent dust better,we use vacuum packing and the rug will appear thin after opening the package,it will take 1-2 days to recover the thickness,Please give this cute rug some time to get better! If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. we will reply to you with 24hours and we take responsibility for all the goods we sell. At last, there are many different worries in life every day, if you happen to see them here, we hope you can be happy every day! Be happy~","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814GwDsdPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUGTUDER","source_asin":"B09F6K5W84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F6K5W84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F6K5W84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
