window.products.push({"id":963719,"name":"TMA Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 250W/25Kpa Brushless Motor Stick Vacuum Cleaner with 4 Filter/8-Cell Battery/45 Mins Running Time/6 in 1/LED Floor Brush ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uUVd6sZ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏡【250W/25Kpa Cordless Vacuum Cleaner】: Upgrade 250W brushless motor vacuum cleaner, quiet, more energy efficient, and longer service life. The suction power of 13Kpa and 25Kpa can be switched freely, suitable for hard floors, wooden floors, and low pile carpets. Quickly cleans large particles, and pet hair, making cleaning even faster. 🔋【TMA Vacuum Cleaner 8-Cell Battery】: Upgrade Detachable battery vacuum cleaner, 8-Cell Lithium-ion 2200mAh battery has a longer battery life than the traditional 6-cell battery with just one full charge, you can clean the whole house at the same time for up to 45 minutes in standard mode (13Kpa), about 18 minutes in MAX mode (25Kpa) 🏡【5-Stage Filtration Vacuum】: The handheld cordless vacuum cleaner adopts a five-stage filtration system, which can remove 99.99% of fine particles, even 0.1 microns, making your life healthier. In addition, it is also equipped with 4 HEPA to meet the replacement needs and prevent the suction power from dropping. Note: Please replace the HEPA every 2-3 months, do not wash it with water. 🏡【Ergonomic Design Vacuum Cleaner】: Stick vacuum cleaner handle uses an extremely ergonomic wide handle design, making it long and clean not tiring, and easy to clean the whole house. Various accessories such as 2 in-1 Brush, Crevice Nozzle so on meet all your daily cleaning needs, whether it is stairs, window sills, sofas, ceilings, cars, etc., effectively remove dirt and dust and make your home sparkle and glow. 🏡【Rotatable LED Motorized Floor Brush & 1.3L Capacity】: The LED light floor brush quickly illuminates and cleans dark corners or hard-to-reach places, tracking dust and dirt. The floor brush can be rotated 180° horizontally and 90° vertically to improve cleaning flexibility and efficiency. The 1.3L large dust cup can accommodate multiple cleanings without frequent trips to the trash can. The \"one-key dust removal\" design makes emptying quick and easy. 🏡【No-Worry Service】: We provide a 2-year warranty and lifetime TMA service support, Whenever you need help, please feel free to contact us and Eliminate cleaning worries and make life easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uUVd6sZ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TMA","source_asin":"B0C49XZTC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C49XZTC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C49XZTC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
