window.products.push({"id":963736,"name":"IRCPEN Sideboard Buffet Storage Cabinet, Small Accent Cabinet with 2 Fabric Door, 31\" Cupboard Door Kitchen Cabinet with Shelves for Bar, Living Room,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fO1CcOAmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 Fabric Door Storage Cabinet】: Farmhouse storage cabinet tend to be functional in both form and function, with simple finishes and a wear-resistant appearance. This wooden storage cabinet features a symmetrical design in high-quality wood grain and a fabric door construction that complements any kitchen or dining room style. This modern buffet sideboard allows you to freely open and close door to display items however you like. 【Wear-Resistant and Sturdy Buffet Sideboard】: Our storage cabinet is made of premium MDF (P2 grade) and solid wood leg which promises a long service life. Environmentally friendly lacquered surface ensures no harm and odorless and make the locker waterproof and easy to maintain. The door slides smoothly and prolongs the number of slides. All the designs and structures make our cabinet withstand the challenges of long-term use. 【Large Storage Space】: Measurements 31.5\" L x 15.7\" W x 34.6\" H, bigger than normal storage cabinet, increase your buying value. The barn doors of the accent kitchen buffet cabinets can be slid left and right to switch freely between open and hidden storage methods, providing ample storage space. 【Multifunctional Storage Cabinet】: Farmhouse style coffee bar cabinets are very comfortable and also versatile enough for home use. The wooden buffet sideboard with sliding barn door is perfect for placement in the kitchen, dining room, living room, office, as a sideboard, buffet, coffee bar, TV cabinet. No matter where it is, the coffee bar cabinet can be the perfect storage cabinet to keep your stuff organized. 【Easy Assembly & Customer Service】: Our storage cabinet comes with clear instructions that shows illustrations and marked all the spare parts. All kinds of screws are labeled and packed in separate bags, all parts are labeled too. Smoothly painted surface is very easy to clean. If you encounter any problems, please feel free to contact our online customer service, we will reply to you as soon as possible, and help you solve your worries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fO1CcOAmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IRCPEN","source_asin":"B0B291N69G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B291N69G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B291N69G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
