window.products.push({"id":963743,"name":"Tully Karessa Y41-7L Premium Cotton 3.0 Weighted Blanket with Glass Beads for Kids, 41\"x60\" 7lbs, Cute Pattern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ui7R8EqHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"About Tully Karissa Weighted Blanket The stress of life and work often makes people unable to get high quality sleep, which will affect the status of the body. With upgrade technology, Tully Karissa Weighted Blanket is able to offer you a nice sleep and make you feel relaxed after a whole day work. With the evenly distributed filled glass beads and premium fabric material, Tully Karissa weighted blanket would make a deep touch pressure stimulation to produce a calming and soothing effect. You would feel the sense of calmness and relief sweeping over you, feel relaxed and have a nice sleep. How Do Weighted Blankets Work? When you curl up under a weighted blanket, the first thing you'll notice is it feels like a big hug. The second thing you'll notice is the sense of calmness and relief that just swept over you. All our blankets are expertly crafted from cotton fabrics and bamboo viscose. We offer the various selection of colors, patterns, weights & sizes, allowing you to create a weighted blanket that's all your own. Weight & Size Choose We recommend 7-12% of your body weight for single & 7. 5% of combined body weight if sharing. The size of Tully Karissa weighted blankets is able to fit for a King/Queen/Full/Twin size bed and sofa perfectly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ui7R8EqHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tully Karessa","source_asin":"B07Y1DCHXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y1DCHXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y1DCHXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
