window.products.push({"id":963881,"name":"Sunset Trading Shabby Chic Cottage Cabinet, Whitewash with raftwood top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619VQTo04BL._SL1024_.jpg","description":"Don’t hide your beautiful belongings! This gorgeous cabinet features glass panel doors with a contemporary matrix face that opens to reveal two levels of storage space. Make a bold statement in your bathroom, hall, entryway and more, wherever you have items to store. ~ Care: Dust with a soft, dry cloth. Avoid using chemical and abrasive cleaners as they may damage the finish ~ Wood has intrinsic distinctions in color and grain pattern and may accept the finishing process differently. These minor imperfections and variation in color enhance the unique beauty of this handcrafted furniture. Studio photography lighting, slight measurement and weight variances are possible. Your viewing device may display colors differently than in real life. The product you receive may vary slightly from the image portrayed. ~ Two year warranty against manufacturer defects","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619VQTo04BL._SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunset Trading","source_asin":"B07NQHTB5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NQHTB5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NQHTB5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":963882,"name":"eek-o Premium Pantry Moth Trap 20 Pack | Responsibly Designed | with Pheromones | Use to Monitor Kitchen Pantry Moth Infestations | Vented Design with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bg9bJmAhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you see a moth in your pantry, it is most likely a Meal Moth; they’re the world’s most common household moths, and they like to eat some of the same things you do. On their life-cycle journey, moths arrive, lay eggs, and larvae emerge to ruin your food. What a waste! With its unique vented design adding 25% More Airflow[1], the eek-o Premium Pantry Moth Trap[2] spreads pheromone evenly. It makes monitoring the food in your pantry for moth infestations is a breeze! [NOTES] 1. eek-o’s unique vented design adds perforations to the trap structure, opening 25% more surface area to airflow. The additional open space allows the movement of a greater volume of air through the trap than would otherwise be the case resulting in a more even pheromone diffusion. 2. the eek-o Premium Pantry Moth Trap is exempt from EPA registration requirements and all provisions of the Federal Insecticide, Fungicide, and Rodenticide Act (FIFRA) as per Section 40 CFR 152.25, subsections (b), and (b)(4).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bg9bJmAhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eek-o","source_asin":"B0B7XX5QVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7XX5QVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7XX5QVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
