window.products.push({"id":963953,"name":"Authentic Models- Salty Dog Skyhook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q92GiGvrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"One of the least liked and heaviest jobs of the Sailing Age was for the sailor to row out the ship's anchor and place it in position. Sometimes several anchors were needed to make for a safe and secure berth. Our rowing sailor seems to carry a light load; at least he makes that impression. Balancing toys have been around for centuries, teaching children and adults about the laws of physics. In Victorian times, originally called skyhooks, but also known as balance toys, were first made to demonstrate the workings of counterweights and centrifugal force: simple counter-weighted toys which could be set on a shelf or the rim of a table, and set in motion to everyone’s delight and amazement. They soon evolved into fun and whimsical objects, never ceasing to amuse and surprise: people loved to watch toys that were doing things that seemed impossible. In an era where the laws of gravity and electricity seemed magical, balance toys became very popular. Even though we now understand the mystery of the laws of gravity, there is still something fascinating and amusing in watching a balanced object lean and sway.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q92GiGvrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AM","source_asin":"B004ZT0R5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004ZT0R5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004ZT0R5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":963954,"name":"Halloween Decorations Indoor Dia De Los Muertos/Day of The Dead Decorations Lighted Porch Signs Banners Outdoor Wall Door Decor (Not Batteries Include","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Uggr9znsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package includes 2pcs lighted Day of the Dead decoration banners,which designed with a couple of ghost bride and groom.The colors are vibrant and eye-catching.Suitable for displaying in Dia De Los Muertos. Measurement & Sizes - The banners are both 69.7” x 12”.Ribbon height measures approx 4”.The banners are made of polyester fabrics and handmade item.Note:The banners came shrink wrapped,you are suggested to use iron to get all the wrinkles out. Powered by 2AA batteries.The lights are cool at night.Lighted up these banners to create a amazing atmosphere at Day of the Dead celebration. Easy to hang - The banners come pre-assembled.They have a sturdy rod & ribbon for easy hanging and 2 extra grommets on the bottom that you can attach weights on to prevent them from blowing in the wind.Used these for your Day of the Dead altar for remember deceased family members. Suitable for Day of the Dead decorations and Halloween decorations.Hanging up these banners in your doorways halls,front door,window,garage door,living room,etc.You can also use them as photo background.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Uggr9znsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yen Jean","source_asin":"B0B6QYTVH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-963954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6QYTVH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6QYTVH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
